# Root .gitignore for AntiGravity E-Commerce (Monorepo)

# Dependencies & Build Artifacts
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/target/
**/.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar

# Logs & Temporary Files
*.log
logs/
temp/
.tempmediaStorage/

# IDE & Environment Files
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/*.local
